        {
          "text": " Kwana kibwaikis itauonokus ka aijarakus amoot EJAKAIT Ekusideke; konyoutu do, kodukoto yesi aibois nakalaunan naka EJAKAIT Edeke, aitolomar asaduku naka aitutuket naka EJAKAIT, ka iboro lukalaunak luka Edeke, togo loekotoi adukokin ekiror loka EJAKAIT,”",
